# Participant-level data must never be committed (see docs/data-use-statement.md)
data/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
!sas/crosscheck/*.csv
!sas/crosscheck/sas_output/*.csv
!results/simulation/*.csv
!results/part_a/*.csv
